<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (Line graph showing standardized Expected Influence \(Z-scores\) on the x-axis, ranging from approximately -2.5 to 1.5, for 31 symptom variables \(labeled with codes starting with I, A, H, and D\) on the y-axis. Points are connected by black lines, with nodes ranked from highest to lowest expected influence.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 39 0 R /Alt (Horizontal lollipop chart showing standardized bridge expected influence z-scores for symptom nodes labeled on the vertical axis, grouped by dimension: avoidance \(blue\), depression \(green\), hyperarousal \(yellow\), and intrusion \(red\), with scores ranging approximately from negative one point five to positive one point five.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 31 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
